    {
      "id": "PKri",
      "code_hash": "d9155c432486363c5aa7e46a7d33e0a8",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: flex-start;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 1.5rem'><marimo-ui-element object-id='PKri-0' random-id='85aa0db6-da0c-8288-af4c-f2434857793f'><marimo-anywidget data-initial-value='{&quot;model_id&quot;:&quot;c43138bca9e74dea87d31dcdf1ce9aa2&quot;}' data-label='null' data-model-id='&quot;c43138bca9e74dea87d31dcdf1ce9aa2&quot;'></marimo-anywidget></marimo-ui-element><div style='max-width:360px'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>The path.</strong> Bend the loop and a dot rides it in time with the\nmusic, once around per loop. Any layer can follow the dot:</span>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>in a layer</th>\n<th>what it is</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>path.x</code></td>\n<td>how far right the dot is, 0 to 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>path.y</code></td>\n<td>how high the dot is, 0 to 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>path.knots</code></td>\n<td>a hit each time the dot passes a knot</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Both <code>path.x</code> and <code>path.y</code> work like <code>sine()</code>: scale them with\n<code>.range(lo, hi)</code>, turn them into notes with <code>.segment(8)</code>.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">In the stack below, the dot's height moves a little arpeggio up\nand down a scale, its left-right position opens the filter and\npans the hats, and every knot is a rim shot.</span></span></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
